  "description": "By chance, Choi Yoonjae comes into possession of Kang Seongho hyung’s wedding ring. Returning it would have been the end of the matter.\n\nBut on a sudden impulse, Yoonjae hides the ring - and finds himself confronting a darkness under Seongho’s watchful eyes that must never be revealed.\n\nIs it loyalty, obsession… or a desire he hasn’t even admitted to himself? What awaits at the end of this dangerous relationship?\n\n---\n\n**Original Novel:**  \nVolumes: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1483016953), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/peoplestory0358)  \nChapters: [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/M_ring5)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/Noirring), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/noir_ring), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000078138), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3543003641)",
